  30:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * @section DESCRIPTION
  31:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  *
  32:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * The GetEventInformation service ACK service handler is used by a client
  33:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * BACnet-user to obtain a summary of all "active event states". The term
  34:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * "active event states" refers to all event-initiating objects that have an
  35:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * Event_State property whose value is not equal to NORMAL, or have an
  36:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * Acked_Transitions property, which has at least one of the bits
  37:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  * (TO-OFFNORMAL, TO-FAULT, TONORMAL) set to FALSE.
  38:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_getevent_a.c ****  */
